": "plays", "meaning": "dráma: play, drama (plural: drámaí)", "ctx": "The things they aim to put on stage."}, {"lit": "of Irish", "meaning": "Gaeilge: Irish", "ctx": "Describes the plays as Irish language plays."}, {"lit": "to", "meaning": "a: verbal particle, to", "ctx": "Introduces the verbal noun chur."}, {"lit": "put", "meaning": "cuir: put (verbal noun: cur, lenited: chur)", "ctx": "Part of a chur ar an stáitse, to put on stage."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "Part of ar an stáitse, on the stage."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Marks stáitse as definite: the stage."}, {"lit": "stage", "meaning": "stáitse: stage", "ctx": "Where the plays are put."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on, by", "ctx": "Introduces the manner phrase ar bhealach."}, {"lit": "way", "meaning": "bealach: way (lenited after ar: bhealach)", "ctx": "Part of ar bhealach, in a way."}, {"lit": "enjoyable", "meaning": "taitneamhach: enjoyable, pleasant", "ctx": "Describes the way the plays are staged."}, {"lit": "are", "meaning": "bí: to be (present: tá)", "ctx": "States that offices exist."}, {"lit": "offices", "meaning": "oifig: office (plural: oifigí)", "ctx": "The company has offices."}, {"lit": "at", "meaning": "ag: at", "ctx": "Used with the company to mean has."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Marks compántas as definite after ag."}, {"lit": "company", "meaning": "compántas: company (eclipsed after ag an: gcompántas)", "ctx": "The company that has offices."}, {"lit": "in", "meaning": "in: in", "ctx": "Introduces the place name."}, {"lit": "Indreabhán", "meaning": "Indreabhán: Inverin", "ctx": "Gives the location of the offices."}, {"lit": "Co.", "meaning": "contae: county (abbreviation: Co.)", "ctx": "Abbreviation before the county name."}, {"lit": "of the", "meaning": "na: of the", "ctx": "Marks the county name in the genitive."}, {"lit": "Galway", "meaning": "Gaillimh: Galway (genitive: Gaillimhe)", "ctx": "Names the county."}, {"lit": "is", "me